{
  "name": "SystemArchitecture",
  "internal_name": "SystemArchitecture",
  "focus": "High-level Tokemak protocol component and flow overview: SystemRegistry and AccessController as shared system services; vault registries, factories, strategies, destination vaults, and external pool adapters for asset deployment and rebalancing; swap router and swapper adapters for token conversion; oracle providers and stats calculators for pricing and snapshots; reward and staking integrations. Show contract/interface boundaries, dependencies, and control and asset/data flow to external tokens, AMMs, oracle providers, and reward protocols.",
